flyplay/odor.py re-implements on FlyGym 2.x the olfaction of FlyGym 1.x
(https://github.com/NeLy-EPFL/flygym-gymnasium, Apache License 2.0), with the
same sensor placement.

flyplay/data/ holds tables derived from published data, each under its own
licence (details and rebuild command in flyplay/data/SOURCES.md):

  door_odorants.csv  from DoOR 2.0.1 (Muench & Galizia 2016, Sci Rep 6:21841;
                     https://github.com/ropensci/DoOR.data), CC BY-SA 4.0.
                     This derived table is distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
  hemibrain_kc.npz   from the hemibrain v1.2 connectome (Scheffer et al. 2020,
                     eLife 9:e57443), CC BY 4.0, with glomerulus labels from
                     Schlegel et al. 2021 (https://github.com/flyconnectome/
                     hemibrain_olf_data), MIT License.
